=== CoPBit Q16_midISI – 2-lane (1 p_ref + 1 data), mid-ISI + FFE + common phase-noise v0 ===
[Param] n_sym          = 200000
[Param] Eb/N0_list(dB) = [8.0, 10.0, 12.0, 14.0, 16.0, 18.0, 20.0]
[Param] theta_std_deg  = 0.0
[Param] mu_phase       = 0.0
[Param] alpha_ref      = 0.3  (0→ref-only, 1→data-only)
[Param] ffe_len        = 13
[Param] train_frac     = 1.0
[Param] mu_ffe         = 0.003
[Param] seed           = 1

